  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into large chunks and place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with savoury seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54596f6e4158183d5e3b22/step-aff90300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Roughly chop red onion. Thinly slice spring onion. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook capsicum and onion until tender, 5-6 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54596f6e4158183d5e3b22/step-40d72b10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer roasted potato chunks and capsicum onion mixture to a large baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and bake until golden, 5-7 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54596f6e4158183d5e3b22/step-761e7c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide baked potato and capsicum hash between bowls.\n• Top with light sour cream (see ingredients) and sweet chilli sauce. Sprinkle with spring onion to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a54596f6e4158183d5e3b22/step-20d72b30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
